# OCTA FIT — root environment example

Copy values into service-specific `.env` files. Do not commit real secrets.

```env
APP_NAME=OCTA_FIT
APP_ENV=local
APP_DEBUG=true

# Laravel
APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=octafit
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=

# AI gateways (Laravel → FastAPI)
AI_COACH_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
AI_PHYSIO_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8002
AI_MOTION_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8003
AI_INTERNAL_TOKEN=replace-with-long-random-string

# Optional LLM (Coach) — leave empty for KB-only demo mode
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Flutter (document only; use dart-define / config)
# API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
# Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:8000/api/v1
```
